  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-03-22T12:54:36.339Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When the dynamic bone limit is reached, *all* dynamic bones on the avatar are disabled.\n\nInstead, I think only the scripts with the most bones on them should be disabled when over the limit (until it goes under the limit again). That way, some of the smaller physics will still work, but the huge skirts/hairs will be disabled.\n\nOne notable example is that people use dynamic bone for smaller things like two-handed weapons, or spinning an object around their finger. I would like to continue seeing these even if the hair physics are turned off by the limiter.",
